                <span class="life">😺</span>
                <span class="life">😺</span>
                <span class="life">😺</span>
                <span class="life">😺</span>
                <span class="life">😺</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2><span class="icon">🔧</span> For Developers</h2>
            <p>
                This backup domain is yet another layer in our multi-layered approach to reliability, 
                working alongside our <strong>Offline Entitlements</strong> and <strong>RC Fortress</strong> systems. 
                It handles scenarios like:
            </p>
            <ul style="margin: 1rem 0 1rem 1.5rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
                <li>DNS propagation issues with our primary domain</li>
                <li>CDN or infrastructure outages</li>
                <li>Regional connectivity problems</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                The switch happens automatically and is completely transparent to your users. 
                No action is required on your part.
            </p>
            <p style="margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
                Curious about how we protect your revenue? Read more:
            </p>
            <div class="blog-links">
                <a href="https://www.revenuecat.com/blog/engineering/introducing-offline-entitlements/" class="blog-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    Introducing Offline Entitlements
                </a>
                <a href="https://www.revenuecat.com/blog/engineering/building-the-rc-fortress/" class="blog-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    Building the RC Fortress
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer>
            <p class="footnote" id="lives-footnote">
                *Depending on where you're from, you might have heard that cats have 9 lives (English-speaking countries), 
                7 lives (Spain, Portugal, Brazil), or even 6 lives (Turkish and Arabic traditions). 
                We went with 9 because we have the best cats
            </p>
        </footer>
